    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πάνειος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πανικός</span>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνειον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανικόν</span>
			, <i>panic</i>, Aen. Tact. <i><span class="en">
				27.1
			</span></i>, al. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα Πελοποννήσιον καὶ
				μάλιστα Ἀρκαδικόν</span>, l.c.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πᾱνεῖον</span></b> , τό, <i>sanctuary of Pan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.1.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
